From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pear <pear@localhost>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [fsdp] feat: activation offload of the checkpointed layers'
 inputs under FSDP2

With FSDP2 and gradient checkpointing, enable_activation_offloading installs CheckpointInputOffload: the inputs
each checkpointed layer keeps for its recompute go to pinned host memory on their own streams until its backward.
It replaces the per-layer groups there, which read each FSDP unit's parameters as plain tensors.
---
